@HostAddress = http://localhost:5065
GET {{HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Pobierz wszystkie samochody (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/cars
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Pobierz jeden samochód po ID (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/cars/6c4501a0-6cfd-4829-9de7-59130d6efbba
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Dodaj nowy samochód (POST)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Ford",
  "model": "Focus",
  "doorsNumber": 5,
  "luggageCapacity": 350,
  "engineCapacity": 1596,
  "fuelType": 0,
  "productionDate": "2023-05-10T00:00:00Z",
  "averageFuelConsumption": 6.5,
  "bodyType": 1
}

###

### 4. Edytuj samochód (PUT)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/cars/6c4501a0-6cfd-4829-9de7-59130d6efbba
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brand": "Ford",
  "model": "Mondeo",
  "doorsNumber": 5,
  "luggageCapacity": 500,
  "engineCapacity": 2000,
  "fuelType": 1,
  "productionDate": "2023-05-10T00:00:00Z",
  "averageFuelConsumption": 7.0,
  "bodyType": 2
}

###

### 5. Usuń samochód (DELETE)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/cars/6c4501a0-6cfd-4829-9de7-59130d6efbba